{"2471110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dr. Psycho: Hospital Escape 2", "steam_appid": 2471110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "🏥 In the heart of &quot;Doctor Psycho's Hospital&quot;, you find yourself trapped in a horrible nightmare, a captive of your own tormented mind. The hospital that was once just a mirror in your mind is now a living hell — a place where your deepest secrets and darkest fears have come true. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471110/extras/7953c79156b24bd102cccaf54427660a.poster.avif?t=1758451869\" width=610 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471110/extras/7953c79156b24bd102cccaf54427660a.webm?t=1758451869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471110/extras/7953c79156b24bd102cccaf54427660a.mp4?t=1758451869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>⚡️Your goal is crystal clear: confront your inner demons, find the hidden items and keys within the hospital's ominous walls and make your way to unlock the escape door that holds your only path to freedom. Escape is your only salvation, but the road is full of danger.<br><br>🪓 The survival depends on your stealth, survival skill and quick actions as you navigate the strange halls of a dangerous hospital, when every step you take could be your last. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471110/extras/d8cf4f0254572e71e1572fef8cf7a98e.poster.avif?t=1758451869\" width=610 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471110/extras/d8cf4f0254572e71e1572fef8cf7a98e.webm?t=1758451869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs